WEBVTT

54:33.213 --> 54:35.090
the water dance.

54:35.215 --> 54:37.384
It is swift...

54:37.509 --> 54:39.678
and sudden.

54:41.221 --> 54:43.390
All men are made of water.

54:43.515 --> 54:45.225
Do you know this?

54:45.350 --> 54:47.602
If you pierce them,

54:47.727 --> 54:51.356
the water leaks out and they die.

54:52.649 --> 54:55.861
Now you will try to strike me.

54:58.989 --> 55:00.740
Ha!
